    "nodes": {
      "offer_1": {
        "lines": [
          "GOLDSKIN MINING Co. WORKS CANTEEN. ROTA. DAY SHIFT 06.00. NIGHT SHIFT 21.00. WATCHMEN TO SIGN ON AT HUT ONE, HUT TWO AND HUT THREE BEFORE THE NIGHT SHIFT.",
          "A square for each hut, each night, ruled in ink. They're filled in down to a night in the spring, and blank after it, all the way to the bottom of the sheet."
        ],
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "Sign on for them",
            "actions": [
              {
                "do": "quest",
                "quest": "shift_rota"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "Leave it"
          }
        ]
      },
      "wait_1": {
        "lines": [
          "SIGN ON AT HUT ONE, HUT TWO AND HUT THREE. Each hut keeps its own book. The rota wants all three before it'll take a mark."
        ]
      },
      "in_1": {
        "lines": [
          "Tonight's squares, one for each hut. I've signed all three books, in my own name, on lines meant for watchmen."
        ],
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "Mark them signed on",
            "actions": [
              {
                "do": "handin",
                "quest": "shift_rota"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "Not yet"
          }
        ]
      },
      "offer_2": {
        "lines": [
          "NIGHT SHIFT TO BE RELIEVED AT 06.00. Against it, in red: NOT RELIEVED. The red's been gone over more than once, by somebody pressing hard.",
          "RELIEF TO REPORT TO THE COOLING YARD."
        ],
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "Report as relief",
            "actions": [
              {
                "do": "quest",
                "quest": "relieve_the_night_shift"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "Leave it"
          }
        ]
      },
      "wait_2": {
        "lines": [
          "RELIEF TO REPORT TO THE COOLING YARD. There are six pairs of boots under the board there. Six, then, to start with."
        ]
      },
      "in_2": {
        "lines": [
          "NOT RELIEVED, in red. The pencil on its string only just reaches it."
        ],
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "Cross it off",
            "actions": [
              {
                "do": "handin",
                "quest": "relieve_the_night_shift"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "Not yet"
          }
        ]
      },
      "after": {
        "lines": [
          "NIGHT SHIFT TO BE RELIEVED AT 06.00. NOT RELIEVED, crossed through in pencil, in my hand. The red shows through the line."
        ]
      }
    }
  },
