    "nodes": {
      "offer": {
        "lines": [
          "A stone carved deep: FOUR TO KEEP THE CORNERS. READ THEM IN TURN.",
          "Lower down, the mason's mark, and a date somebody has taken off again with a chisel. Carefully, a figure at a time.",
          "Under that, an arrow cut toward the Hoar Stone."
        ],
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "Read them",
            "actions": [
              {
                "do": "quest",
                "quest": "goldskins_four"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "Leave it"
          }
        ]
      },
      "wait": {
        "lines": [
          "FOUR TO KEEP THE CORNERS. The markers stand round the Hoar Stone, one to a side. In turn, it says."
        ]
      },
      "in": {
        "lines": [
          "FOUR TO KEEP THE CORNERS. I've read all four: I, II, III, and the last cut IIII by somebody who didn't trust IV."
        ],
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "Read, all four",
            "actions": [
              {
                "do": "handin",
                "quest": "goldskins_four"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "Not yet"
          }
        ]
      },
      "after": {
        "lines": [
          "FOUR TO KEEP THE CORNERS. There's chalk in the letters, where I rubbed it in to read them. The rain hasn't had it out yet."
        ]
      }
    }
  },
