            "if": "questDone",
            "quest": "breen_coal",
            "not": true
          }
        ],
        "node": "offer"
      },
      {
        "node": "after"
      }
    ],
    "nodes": {
      "offer": {
        "lines": [
          "Good evening. Sorry. Hut One, this, and I'd ask you in, but it's colder in than out. The stove's been out since the spring. I keep meaning to see to it.",
          "There's coal in the slag wagons down the Sidings. Three lumps would see me through. I'd fetch it myself, only I can't leave the hut. Sorry. You'd think I could."
        ],
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "I'll fetch it",
            "actions": [
              {
                "do": "quest",
                "quest": "breen_coal"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "Not now"
          }
        ]
      },
      "wait": {
        "lines": [
          "The Sidings. The wagons with coal in. Three lumps, if it's no trouble. Sorry, I've said that."
        ]
      },
      "in": {
        "lines": [
          "That's the stuff. Three. Sorry, my hands are bad with the cold, I'll be a minute laying it.",
          "You lay a stove like you lay a table, my mother said. Then it's ready for whoever comes."
        ],
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "Here",
            "actions": [
              {
                "do": "handin",
                "quest": "breen_coal"
              },
              {
                "do": "take",
                "item": "coal",
                "qty": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "Not yet"
          }
        ]
      },
      "after": {
        "lines": [
          "Sit by it if you're passing. Sorry it's not much of a fire. It's a long night in a hut with nobody to say good evening to.",
          "Keep off Cinder Walk once it's dark. The night shift has it from nine, and they don't step aside for anybody. I've watched them not."
        ]
      }
    }
  },
